    "title": "Front Office Manager - FabHotels International Enterprises - Growth Opportunity",
    "description": "Grow your career with FabHotels International Enterprises! We are hiring a Front Office Manager for our Vijayawada team. Be part of a workplace that celebrates innovation, diversity, and performance.\n\nAbout FabHotels International Enterprises:\nFabHotels International Enterprises is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Manage front office operations including check-in/check-out\n• Coordinate housekeeping and maintenance for room readiness\n• Monitor F&B service quality and maintain hygiene standards\n• Train and supervise front-line staff on service standards\n• Conduct regular guest satisfaction surveys and implement improvements\n• Coordinate with travel agents and OTAs for occupancy optimization\n• Deliver exceptional guest experiences in line with brand standards\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• CA / CMA / CFA certification\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Hotel Management\n• Proficiency in Housekeeping Standards\n• Proficiency in Revenue Management\n• Proficiency in F&B Service\n• Proficiency in Food Safety\n• Proficiency in Front Office\n• Proficiency in HACCP\n• Proficiency in Sommelier Skills\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Referral bonus program\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Vijayawada, Andhra Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with FabHotels International Enterprises!",
